<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Clé d'Or — Conciergerie Airbnb Premium</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,800;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root {
  --cream: #F5EEE0;
  --cream-2: #EFE6D2;
  --cream-3: #E8DCC0;
  --ink: #1A1A18;
  --ink-soft: #3D3A33;
  --forest: #1F3A2D;
  --forest-2: #2D4A3E;
  --gold: #B8902F;
  --gold-2: #D4A946;
  --terracotta: #B5532A;
  --grey: #6B6660;
}

* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.6;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

body::before {
  content: ''; position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(184,144,47,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 60%, rgba(31,58,45,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 60px 60px, 80px 80px;
}

nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
  padding: 1.4rem 3rem;
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  background: rgba(245,238,224,0.94);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,58,45,0.08);
}
.logo {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--forest);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.5rem;
}
.logo-mark {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 8px; height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.2rem; list-style: none; }
.nav-links a {
  color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500;
  transition: color 0.3s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--forest); }
.nav-cta {
  background: var(--forest); color: var(--cream);
  border: none; padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: 100px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-1px); }

#hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 9rem 3rem 4rem;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem; align-items: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}
.hero-left { position: relative; }
.hero-issue {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
}
.hero-issue::before {
  content: ''; width: 40px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold);
}
h1 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 0.98;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
h1 em {
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--forest);
}
.hero-lead {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  max-width: 480px;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}
.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn {
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600;
  padding: 1.05rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 100px;
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
  border: none;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
}
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--forest); color: var(--cream);
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.btn-text {
  background: transparent; color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px;
  text-decoration-color: var(--gold);
}
.btn-text:hover { color: var(--forest); }

.hero-right {
  position: relative;
  height: 70vh;
  min-height: 500px;
  background: var(--forest);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 3rem;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  color: var(--cream);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-right::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -50%; right: -30%;
  width: 80%; height: 80%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--gold) 0%, transparent 60%);
  opacity: 0.18;
}
.hero-right-top {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic; font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--cream-3);
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
}
.hero-right-num {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
}
.big-percent {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(7rem, 14vw, 11rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 0.85;
  color: var(--gold-2);
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
}
.big-percent-label {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--cream);
  margin-top: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  max-width: 320px;
}
.hero-right-bot {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,238,224,0.2);
  padding-top: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--cream-3);
}
.hero-right-bot strong { color: var(--gold-2); font-weight: 600; }

#stats {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--cream);
  padding: 3rem 3rem;
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.stats-marquee {
  display: flex; gap: 4rem;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.stats-marquee em {
  color: var(--gold-2); font-style: italic;
}
.stats-marquee span {
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cream-3);
  display: inline-block; transform: translateY(-8px);
  margin: 0 0.5rem;
}
.stats-dot {
  width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--gold); display: inline-block;
}

.section { padding: 8rem 3rem; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.container { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }

.eyebrow {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
}
.eyebrow::before {
  content: ''; width: 30px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold);
}
.section-h {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.section-h em { font-style: italic; color: var(--forest); font-weight: 400; }
.section-lead {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  max-width: 560px;
}

#process .container {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
  gap: 5rem; align-items: start;
}
.process-header { position: sticky; top: 7rem; }
.process-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
.step {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
  gap: 2rem; padding: 2.5rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,58,45,0.1);
  align-items: start;
}
.step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.step-num {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 2.6rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1;
}
.step h3 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.step p {
  font-size: 0.96rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.65;
  max-width: 520px;
}

#services {
  background: var(--cream-2);
}
.services-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 4rem;
}
.svc {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 2.5rem;
  border-radius: 6px;
  position: relative;
  transition: all 0.4s ease;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,58,45,0.06);
}
.svc:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(31,58,45,0.08); }
.svc-num {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
}
.svc h4 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.svc p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }

.svc.large { grid-column: span 6; background: var(--forest); color: var(--cream); }
.svc.large h4 { color: var(--cream); font-size: 1.8rem; }
.svc.large p  { color: var(--cream-3); font-size: 0.95rem; }
.svc.large .svc-num { color: var(--gold-2); }
.svc.medium { grid-column: span 6; }
.svc.medium.dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); }
.svc.medium.dark h4 { color: var(--cream); }
.svc.medium.dark p  { color: var(--cream-3); }
.svc.medium.dark .svc-num { color: var(--gold-2); }
.svc.small { grid-column: span 4; }
.svc.tall  { grid-column: span 4; grid-row: span 2; background: var(--gold); }
.svc.tall h4 { font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--ink); }
.svc.tall p  { color: var(--ink-soft); }

#revenu .container {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
  gap: 5rem; align-items: center;
}
.revenu-display {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--cream);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 3.5rem;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.revenu-display::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--gold), var(--gold-2), var(--gold));
}
.revenu-tag {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic;
  font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gold-2);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.revenu-amount {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 6.5rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--gold-2);
  line-height: 0.9;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}
.revenu-per {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic;
  font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--cream-3);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.revenu-sub {
  font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--cream-3); margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.revenu-rows {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,238,224,0.15);
  padding-top: 1.8rem;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;
}
.revenu-row {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
}
.revenu-row.divider {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,238,224,0.15);
  padding-top: 1rem; margin-top: 0.4rem;
}
.revenu-row span { color: var(--cream-3); }
.revenu-row strong { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 500; }
.revenu-row .gold { color: var(--gold-2); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.revenu-row .red { color: #d97a6a; }

#commission {
  background: var(--forest);
  color: var(--cream);
}
#commission .section-h { color: var(--cream); }
#commission .section-h em { color: var(--gold-2); }
.comm-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 5rem; align-items: center;
  margin-top: 4rem;
}
.comm-num {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(10rem, 22vw, 18rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--gold-2);
  line-height: 0.85;
  letter-spacing: -0.05em;
}
.comm-num em { font-style: italic; }
.comm-side {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--cream);
  line-height: 1.5;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  max-width: 380px;
}
.comm-included {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem;
}
.comm-inc {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
  padding: 0.6rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,238,224,0.1);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--cream-3);
}
.comm-inc:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.comm-inc::before {
  content: '+'; color: var(--gold-2);
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500;
}

#temoignages { background: var(--cream-2); }
.temo-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 2rem; margin-top: 4rem;
}
.temo {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 2.5rem;
  border-radius: 6px;
  position: relative;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,58,45,0.06);
}
.temo-mark {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 4rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  line-height: 0.5;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  display: block;
  height: 30px;
}
.temo-text {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.temo-stars {
  color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.85rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.temo-author {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.2rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(31,58,45,0.1);
  padding-top: 1.2rem;
}
.temo-author strong {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--forest); font-weight: 500;
}
.temo-author span {
  font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--grey);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

#contact {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--cream);
}
#contact .container {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 5rem; align-items: center;
}
#contact .eyebrow { color: var(--gold-2); }
#contact .eyebrow::before { background: var(--gold-2); }
#contact .section-h { color: var(--cream); }
#contact .section-h em { color: var(--gold-2); }
.contact-lead {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  color: var(--cream-3);
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.contact-info {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem;
}
.contact-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;
  padding: 1rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,238,224,0.1);
}
.contact-item-label {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cream-3);
  min-width: 90px;
}
.contact-item-val {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  color: var(--gold-2);
  font-weight: 500;
}
.contact-form {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 3rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.form-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.form-sub {
  font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.contact-form input, .contact-form select {
  width: 100%;
  background: var(--cream-2);
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  padding: 0.95rem 1.1rem;
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink);
  border-radius: 4px;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color 0.3s;
}
.contact-form input:focus, .contact-form select:focus {
  border-color: var(--forest);
}
.contact-form input::placeholder { color: var(--grey); }
.contact-form select { color: var(--grey); cursor: pointer; }
.form-submit {
  width: 100%;
  background: var(--forest);
  color: var(--cream);
  padding: 1.1rem;
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600;
  border: none; border-radius: 100px;
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
  margin-top: 0.6rem;
}
.form-submit:hover { background: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-1px); }

footer {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 3rem;
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(31,58,45,0.1);
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
}
.footer-logo {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  color: var(--forest); font-weight: 500;
}
.footer-text { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--grey); }
.footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
.footer-links a {
  font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--ink-soft);
  text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;
}
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--forest); }

.reveal {
  opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px);
  transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
}
.reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

@media (max-width: 960px) {
  nav { padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; }
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  #hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 7rem 1.5rem 3rem; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .hero-right { height: auto; min-height: 400px; padding: 2rem; }
  .section { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }
  #process .container, #revenu .container, .comm-grid, #contact .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  .process-header { position: static; }
  .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .svc.large, .svc.medium, .svc.small, .svc.tall { grid-column: span 1; grid-row: auto; }
  .temo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .contact-form { padding: 2rem; }
  footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  .stats-marquee { font-size: 1.2rem; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">
    <span class="logo-mark"></span>
    Clé d'Or
  </div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#process">Le processus</a></li>
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#commission">Tarifs</a></li>
    <li><a href="#temoignages">Témoignages</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-cta" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Être rappelé</button>
</nav>

<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-issue">Conciergerie Airbnb · Belgique · 2025</div>
    <h1>Votre bien,<br>notre <em>savoir-faire</em>.</h1>
    <p class="hero-lead">
      Nous transformons votre appartement, maison ou villa en source de revenus mensuels. Vous gardez les clés. Nous nous occupons du reste.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
        Estimer mes revenus →
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-text" onclick="document.getElementById('process').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
        Découvrir le concept
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="hero-right-top">
      <span>— Le potentiel</span>
      <span>nº 01</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right-num">
      <div class="big-percent">+104<span style="font-size:0.6em">%</span></div>
      <div class="big-percent-label">
        de revenus supplémentaires par rapport à une location classique.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right-bot">
      <span>Source : <strong>moyenne Bruxelles 2024</strong></span>
      <span>p. 01</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="stats">
  <div class="stats-marquee">
    <em>78%</em> <span>taux d'occupation</span>
    <span class="stats-dot"></span>
    <em>48h</em> <span>mise en ligne</span>
    <span class="stats-dot"></span>
    <em>0€</em> <span>frais fixes</span>
    <span class="stats-dot"></span>
    <em>15%</em> <span>commission unique</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="process" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process-header reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Le processus</div>
      <h2 class="section-h">Simple comme<br><em>donner ses clés.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Trois étapes. Aucun engagement. Une seule promesse — vous ne touchez à rien.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">i.</div>
        <div>
          <h3>L'estimation</h3>
          <p>Nous évaluons gratuitement le potentiel locatif de votre bien. Analyse du quartier, de la surface, des tendances locales. Vous recevez un chiffre concret en 24h.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">ii.</div>
        <div>
          <h3>La mise en valeur</h3>
          <p>Séance photo professionnelle, rédaction soignée de l'annonce, création de votre profil Airbnb, tarification dynamique. Votre logement devient une expérience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">iii.</div>
        <div>
          <h3>La gestion complète</h3>
          <p>Réservations, communication, accueil, ménage après chaque séjour, support voyageurs 24/7. Vous recevez vos revenus chaque mois — sans effort.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Nos services</div>
      <h2 class="section-h">Tout est <em>inclus.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Une seule commission, aucun supplément. Vous savez exactement ce que vous payez — et ce que vous recevez en retour.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="svc large reveal">
        <div class="svc-num">— i.</div>
        <h4>Gestion complète des réservations</h4>
        <p>Nous répondons aux voyageurs 24h/24, gérons les demandes, les confirmations et les imprévus. Aucun appel, aucun email — votre tranquillité d'abord.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc medium dark reveal">
        <div class="svc-num">— ii.</div>
        <h4>Ménage professionnel</h4>
        <p>Notre équipe intervient après chaque départ. Logement impeccable, linge frais, accueil parfait.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc small reveal">
        <div class="svc-num">— iii.</div>
        <h4>Photos & annonce pro</h4>
        <p>Mise en scène professionnelle de votre bien pour maximiser l'attractivité.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc tall reveal">
        <div class="svc-num">— iv.</div>
        <h4>Tarification dynamique</h4>
        <p>Vos prix sont ajustés en temps réel selon la demande, les événements locaux et la saisonnalité. Plus de manque à gagner.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc small reveal">
        <div class="svc-num">— v.</div>
        <h4>Vérification voyageurs</h4>
        <p>Profils contrôlés, dépôt de garantie, couverture AirCover.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc small reveal">
        <div class="svc-num">— vi.</div>
        <h4>Tableau de bord</h4>
        <p>Suivez revenus, taux d'occupation et avis en temps réel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="revenu" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Cas concret</div>
